<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Subscription Cancellation Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #0F172A; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f7; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6b7280 0%, #4b5563 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
        .header .icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .cancel-box { background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .cancel-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .cancel-text { color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
        .access-box { background: #eff6ff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; text-align: center; }
        .access-title { font-size: 14px; color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .access-date { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; }
        .access-note { font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 8px; }
        .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
        .details-table td { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .details-table td:first-child { color: #6b7280; }
        .details-table td:last-child { text-align: right; font-weight: 500; }
        .resubscribe-box { background: #FBDDE0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #A82D49; text-align: center; }
        .resubscribe-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #85182F; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .resubscribe-text { color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #85182F; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 10px 5px; }
        .btn-secondary { background: #ffffff; color: #85182F !important; border: 2px solid #85182F; }
        .feedback { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .feedback h4 { margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #0F172A; font-size: 14px; }
        .feedback p { margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px; }
        .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
        .footer a { color: #85182F; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="icon">👋</div>
            <h1>Subscription Canceled</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
            
            <p>We're sorry to see you go. Your subscription cancellation has been confirmed.</p>
            
            <div class="cancel-box">
                <div class="cancel-title">Cancellation Confirmed</div>
                <div class="cancel-text">Your {{planName}} subscription has been canceled.</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="access-box">
                <div class="access-title">You'll have access until</div>
                <div class="access-date">{{accessUntilDate}}</div>
                <div class="access-note">After this date, you'll be moved to our free tier.</div>
            </div>
            
            <table class="details-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Cancellation Date</td>
                    <td>{{cancellationDate}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Canceled Plan</td>
                    <td>{{planName}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Monthly Amount</td>
                    <td>{{currency}} {{amount}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{#if refundAmount}}
                <tr>
                    <td>Prorated Refund</td>
                    <td>{{currency}} {{refundAmount}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/if}}
            </table>
            
            <div class="resubscribe-box">
                <div class="resubscribe-title">Changed your mind?</div>
                <div class="resubscribe-text">You can reactivate your subscription anytime before {{accessUntilDate}} and pick up right where you left off.</div>
                <a href="{{resubscribeUrl}}" class="btn">Reactivate Subscription</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feedback">
                <h4>We'd love to hear from you</h4>
                <p>Your feedback helps us improve. If you have a moment, please let us know why you decided to cancel. <a href="{{feedbackUrl}}" style="color: #85182F;">Share feedback</a></p>
            </div>
            
            <p>Thank you for being a customer. We hope to see you again in the future!</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The {{companyName}} Team</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>{{companyName}} • {{companyAddress}}</p>
            <p>
                <a href="{{billingPortalUrl}}">Billing Portal</a> • 
                <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Support</a> • 
                <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Email Preferences</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

